TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium in pure water with fixed O2; allow Goethite and Gypsum
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7  10
    Pyrite   0    0.1
    Goethite 0    10
    Gypsum   0    10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -pH true
    -molalities H+
END
